Cell["\<\
Apart  from the bases, we need to define the dressings (i.e. the prefactors \
in front of each tensor structure) for each object. As a sanity check we \
check, that the propagator is really the inverse of the two-point function \
and regulator. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9883564027721777`*^9, 3.988356436020177*^9}, {
  3.988356525260474*^9, 
  3.988356562844935*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"545bb5a0-d317-41d5-82f4-\
8f424044cfaa"],

